d14d79f4-8fbf-f111-aaaf-0022482913fc ("ONTOLOGY DEV SEED 005 - Negative Control 2") with a budget-exceeding
sprk_spendsnapshot but zero communications -- exists conjunct fails. All three hand-evaluated against the task
